Finally I have success with Xenomia on X86_64 Linux 2.6.37.6.
Here is the output of xeno-test attached.


The problem written earlier on the following modprobe is not seen any more =
now!!!
root@domain.hid:~> /usr/xenomai/bin/latency -t0 -p200 -f -T50
